WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:01.700
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.800
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:10.248 --> 00:00:12.548
她：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
Her: (Doesn't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:12.648 --> 00:00:15.797
她：我是楼上的摄影师。
I'm a photographer. Upstairs.

00:00:15.997 --> 00:00:19.147
摄影师。
A photographer.

00:00:22.696 --> 00:00:24.506
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:26.715 --> 00:00:28.525
Harland把订婚宣布提前了，还有十分钟。
Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:32.844 --> 00:00:35.144
她：你说我害的？我到底做了什么？
Her: My doing? What did I actually do?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:38.393
她：你说我害的？我到底做了什么？
You blame me? What did I do?

00:00:38.593 --> 00:00:41.743
什么都没做。你只是存在。
Nothing. You just exist.

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:52.628
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:52.828 --> 00:00:55.140
跟我走。
Come with me.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.740
她：Mate是什么意思？你说清楚再说跟你走。
Her: What does Mate mean? Explain before I go with you.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:02.664
她：她：先解释Mate，再说跟你走。
Explain Mate first. Then I'll come.

00:01:02.864 --> 00:01:07.688
他：唯一的一个。我们每个人，只有一个。
One. Only one for each of us.

00:01:07.888 --> 00:01:09.363
他：我们是狼人。我不是人类。
We're wolves. I'm not human.

00:01:12.912 --> 00:01:14.387
他：开车。
Drive.

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:20.336
她：我把手覆上他的拳头。
Her: I lay my hand over his fist.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:23.785 --> 00:01:26.935
你不怕？
You're not afraid?

00:01:32.996 --> 00:01:35.308
你的手很暖。
Your hand is warm.

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:40.332
他转回来：它们在叫了。
They're calling.

00:01:40.632 --> 00:01:42.932
她：他们是谁？为什么要让他们来？
Her: Who are they? Why let them come?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:01:43.032 --> 00:01:47.856
她：她问：他们是谁？为什么让他们来？
Who are they? Why let them?

00:01:48.056 --> 00:01:52.880
他答：我的族人。他们会想要你。
My pack. They'll want you.

00:01:58.104 --> 00:02:00.416
他按断，目光回到她脸上：让他们来。
Let them come.

00:02:03.228 --> 00:02:05.528
她：我跟你走进起居室。
Her: I follow you into the living room.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:02:05.628 --> 00:02:08.777
她：我跟你走进去。
I'll go in with you.

00:02:08.977 --> 00:02:12.127
那就来。
Then come.

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:23.012
是我的气味，会好的。
It's my scent. It'll settle.

00:02:23.212 --> 00:02:25.524
这里是我的领地。你是我本不该找到的那个人。
This is my territory. You're the one thing I never.

00:02:25.824 --> 00:02:28.124
她：我不是冷。你丢下订婚，然后呢？
Her: I'm not cold. You walked out on the engagement. Then what?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:28.224 --> 00:02:31.373
她：我不是冷。
I'm not cold.

00:02:31.573 --> 00:02:34.723
我走了。
I walked away.

00:02:38.272 --> 00:02:40.584
Selene从来都不是我的。
Selene was never mine.

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:45.608
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:50.720
她：Selene是谁？让她进来，我倒要看看。
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:55.644
她：我是说，Selene是谁？让她进来。
Who is Selene? Let her in.

00:02:55.844 --> 00:03:00.668
Luca，开门。
Luca. Open the door.

00:03:02.878 --> 00:03:04.687
待在我身边。
Stay beside me.

00:03:04.887 --> 00:03:06.697
原来是真的。一个人类？
So it's true. A human?

00:03:11.016 --> 00:03:13.316
她：我走过去，把手贴上他的脸。
Her: I walk over and lay my hand on his face.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:23.264
我不是要你留下。
I'm not asking you to stay.

00:03:28.488 --> 00:03:30.800
那是什么？
Then what is it?

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.312
跟我来，车备好了。
Come with me. The car is ready.

00:03:33.612 --> 00:03:35.912
她：我也不知道。但你得保证，没人能带走我。
Her: I don't know either. But promise me nobody can take me.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:03:36.012 --> 00:03:39.161
她：我不知道。但你得保证。
I don't know. But promise me.

00:03:42.711 --> 00:03:45.860
没人能带走你。我保证。
No one takes you. I promise.

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:48.372
你想走，随时可以走。
If you want to leave, you can.

00:03:53.596 --> 00:03:55.908
Harland今晚要你。
Harland wants you tonight.

00:03:56.208 --> 00:03:58.508
她：我握紧他的手，说我留下
Her: I grip his hand and say I'll stay
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:03:58.608 --> 00:04:01.757
她：我留下。
I'm staying.

00:04:01.957 --> 00:04:05.107
再说一遍。
Say it again.

00:04:16.192 --> 00:04:18.504
找了这么多年，你值得。
Thirty years. You were worth it.

00:04:18.804 --> 00:04:21.104
她：我踮起脚，吻上他的唇。
Her: I rise on tiptoe and kiss him.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:04:26.228 --> 00:04:31.052
小心点，我可能停不下来。
Careful. I might not stop.

00:04:36.276 --> 00:04:38.588
今晚留下来陪我。
Stay with me tonight.

00:04:38.788 --> 00:04:41.100
她：我哪儿也不去。
I'm not going anywhere.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.700
她：那是什么声音？是他们来了吗？
Her: What's that sound? Are they here?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 13 轮 · Realtime round 13）

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.949
她：她低声问：那是什么声音？是他们来了吗？
What was that sound? Are they here?

00:04:47.149 --> 00:04:50.299
他答：长老会的钟声，他们在等。
The Council bell. They're waiting.

00:04:53.848 --> 00:04:56.160
Luca的声音：Alpha，Harland召集了长老，今晚要人。
Alpha. Harland called the elders. Tonight.

00:04:58.872 --> 00:05:01.184
他对她说：那就让他们当面听我的答复。
Then they'll hear my answer.

00:05:03.996 --> 00:05:06.296
她：我跟你去，但你不许松开我的手。
Her: I'll go with you, but don't let go of my hand.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 14 轮 · Realtime round 14）

00:05:06.396 --> 00:05:09.545
她：我跟你去，但不许松手。
I'll come. Don't let go.

00:05:09.745 --> 00:05:12.895
永远不会。一次都不会。
Never. Not once.

00:05:18.454 --> 00:05:20.263
来，他们在等。
Come. They're waiting.

00:05:24.482 --> 00:05:26.292

Stay beside me.
